  <title>Die Center Offsets to Package Center</title> 
  <body> 
	 <ul id="UL_CCF8CB2CBD864FF08E015EAB4243EC42"> 
		<li id="LI_246B89C7A48748C1A5D526651D1A721B">An ideal thermal solution design would apply a load as uniform as possible on all dies in order to optimize thermal performance and minimize mechanical risk. 
		</li> 
		<li id="LI_B96B44D9F2F4439CBBBFA6E20D80A787">The heat pipe should be oriented to cover the hot spots on the die (refer 
		  <xref scope="local" format="dita" href="GUID-C502FA2A-FDE3-45D8-ABFE-FDE87310920A.dita"><?xm-replace_text Design for PL2?></xref>). 
		</li> 
		<li id="LI_889B6EC7E509486EA58C8357E6036998">Refer Nova Lake Mobile Platform Package Mechanical Models and Drawings (#<xref href="https://cdrdv2.intel.com/V1/DL/GETCONTENT/858127" format="https" scope="external">858127</xref>), for specific package dimensions and die locations. 
		</li> 
	 </ul> 
